{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q3742035","formula":"Cu·Fe·Ni·Zn","hill":"CuFeNiZn","elements":["Fe","Ni","Cu","Zn"],"composition":{"Cu":1.0,"Fe":1.0,"Ni":1.0,"Zn":1.0},"names":{"en":"Melchior","ru":"Мельхиор","uk":"Мельхіор"},"descriptions":{"en":"In metallurgy, melchior is an alloy of copper, mainly with nickel (5–30%). Its name originates from Italian: melchior, which in turn is distorted French: maillechort, honoring the French inventors of the alloy, Maillot and Chorier. The term melchior sometimes refers not only to the copper-nickel alloys, but also ternary alloys of copper with nickel and zinc (\"nickel silver\") and even a silvered brass.","ru":"Мельхио́р (нем. Melchior, искажённое фр. maillechort) — однофазный сплав меди с никелем, иногда с добавками железа и марганца, получивший своё название по именам изобретателей из Лиона Майо (Maillot) и Шорье (Chorier или Chortier), которые создали этот сплав в 1819 году.","uk":"Мельхіо́р (нім. Melchior, від імені винахідників Майо́ і Шор'є́ (фр. Maillot, Chorier)) — група сплавів міді (основа) переважно з нікелем (5-30 %), а також з Fe (приблизно 1 %) та Mn (близько 1 %)."},"fame":14,"pubchemCid":null,"mass":null,"charge":0,"smiles":null,"inchikey":null,"iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q214609","names":{"en":"material","ru":"материал","uk":"матеріал"}},{"qid":"Q37756","names":{"en":"alloy","ru":"сплав","uk":"сплави"}}],"structureInfo":null,"structure":null,"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q3742035","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Melchior_%28alloy%29","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (ru)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%9C%D0%B5%D0%BB%D1%8C%D1%85%D0%B8%D0%BE%D1%80","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (uk)","url":"https://uk.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%9C%D0%B5%D0%BB%D1%8C%D1%85%D1%96%D0%BE%D1%80","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"ro